<SCENARIO VER="105">
{MESOFF "500"}
<TXSPN>I am sorry, but this world is extremely unstable.<PG>
Please be aware that from time to time an item appears as a string of unreadable characters.<PG>
Also, it seems that on very rare occasions an element with no connection at all to the encyclopedia slips in.<PG>
You may be very startled when that happens, but I humbly ask your forgiveness.<PG>
If something unrelated has slipped in, please let me know in Chatter. I will deal with it at once.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
